"""Capacity-driven production watchdog — probe → learn → GREEN-only auto-start.

Cron-friendly one-shot: each invocation decides whether to probe, updates the
availability heatmap, and may start **one** production farm job when GREEN.

Hard rule (CTO): factory GPU starts only on GREEN. YELLOW/RED never enqueue
visuals. FACTORY_ALWAYS_ON=1 keeps sleep_factory + watchdog ARMED 365d (no holiday sleep).

Phase split (CTO 2026-08-07):
  - Phase A (anytime / RED-YELLOW OK, or while GPU busy): script+Kokoro → ``ready_for_stills``
  - Phase B (GREEN only): prefer parked voice-ready jobs → stills→compose→publish
  - GREEN with no prep buffer: fall back to full pipeline (use the window)
  - Locks: ``MAX_GPU_CONCURRENT=1`` (never 2 pods) + ``MAX_PREP_CONCURRENT=1``
    with ``RUNPOD_PREP_WHILE_GPU=1`` so prep can bank voice while stills run
    (pod ``visuals`` only — not during local script/TTS/compose)

Sheet-driven (CTO 2026-08-07): while Excel/sheet has ideas with approved=TRUE
(ready), keep producing 1-by-1 GPU jobs whenever capacity is GREEN.
No soft/hard daily *job count* caps — CostGuardian $ ceilings still apply.
Always re-probe the traffic light before each start. After success → short
cooldown → eligible for next if still GREEN + more pending ideas.
"""

